     "content_html": "<p>“Wonder Woman is stronger than Captain Marvel” is the negation of “Wonder Woman is not stronger than Captain Marvel.”</p>\n<p>Thus, symbolically you write <span data-math=\"{\\sim}({\\sim}p)=p\"></span>.</p>"
