     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The statement <span data-math=\"r\"></span> represents “Woody and Buzz Lightyear are best friends.”</p>\n<p>The negation <span data-math=\"{\\sim}r\"></span> is translated “Woody and Buzz Lightyear are not best friends.”</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Woody and Buzz Lightyear are not best friends."
